{"id":"23deb51a65e1127c","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-obdd.md","title":"Ordered binary decision diagrams","display":"df-obdd — Ordered binary decision diagrams","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-obdd","aliases":["27-df-obdd"],"display":"df-obdd — Ordered binary decision diagrams","depends_on":["[[27-df-bdd]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.12.3","source_printed_pages":"47,48","source_pdf_pages":"71,72","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-obdd"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-obdd</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-obdd — Ordered binary decision diagrams"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c4aaed843fab5b1c\" href=\"?note=c4aaed843fab5b1c\" title=\"27-df-bdd\">27-df-bdd</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.12.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"47,48"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"71,72"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为非空有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq V\">\\(I\\subseteq V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in V\">\\(r\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0,s_1:I\\to V\">\\(s_0,s_1:I\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda:I\\to[n]\">\\(\\lambda:I\\to[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\">\\(G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDD}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BDD}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4aaed843fab5b1c\" href=\"?note=c4aaed843fab5b1c\" title=\"27-df-bdd\">27-df-bdd</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:[n]\\to[n]\">\\(\\rho:[n]\\to[n]\\)</span> 为双射。下式定义有序 BDD 谓词与使用有限整数顶点编码的有序 BDD 集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderedBDD}_n(G,\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\land\n\\forall v,u\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(s_b(v)=u\\Rightarrow\\rho(\\lambda(v))&lt;\\rho(\\lambda(u))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrderedBDD}_n(G,\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\land\n\\forall v,u\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(s_b(v)=u\\Rightarrow\\rho(\\lambda(v))&lt;\\rho(\\lambda(u))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\left\\{([q],I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\\mid I\\subseteq[q],\\ r\\in[q],\\ s_0,s_1\\in[q]^I,\\ \\lambda\\in[n]^I,\\ \\tau\\in\\mathbb B^{[q]\\setminus I}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\left\\{([q],I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\\mid I\\subseteq[q],\\ r\\in[q],\\ s_0,s_1\\in[q]^I,\\ \\lambda\\in[n]^I,\\ \\tau\\in\\mathbb B^{[q]\\setminus I}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OBDD}_n\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathcal C_n\\mid\\exists\\rho:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\mathrm{OrderedBDD}_n(G,\\rho)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OBDD}_n\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathcal C_n\\mid\\exists\\rho:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\mathrm{OrderedBDD}_n(G,\\rho)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿每条弧变量秩严格增加，因而任何根到叶路径至多读取每个变量一次。使用秩函数而不是把排列的值和位置混用；不要求每条路径都出现全部变量，也不把有序性误写为图必须是一棵树。 OBDD_n 只收集以 [q] 为顶点集的编码，C_n 是可数个有限编码集的并，确为集合；任意有限命名的图可经顶点重编号得到其中一个编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-bdd","status":"resolved","id":"c4aaed843fab5b1c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-bdd]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-bdd","status":"resolved","id":"c4aaed843fab5b1c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N^+$。$V$ 为非空有限集，$I\\subseteq V$，$r\\in V$，$s_0,s_1:I\\to V$，$\\lambda:I\\to[n]$，$\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B$，$G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)$；$\\mathrm{BDD}_n$ 见 [[27-df-bdd]]。$\\rho:[n]\\to[n]$ 为双射。下式定义有序 BDD 谓词与使用有限整数顶点编码的有序 BDD 集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"s_0,s_1:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda:I\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:V\\setminus I\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BDD}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:[n]\\to[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderedBDD}_n(G,\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{BDD}_n(G)\\land\n\\forall v,u\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B\\;(s_b(v)=u\\Rightarrow\\rho(\\lambda(v))<\\rho(\\lambda(u))).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\left\\{([q],I,r,s_0,s_1,\\lambda,\\tau)\\mid I\\subseteq[q],\\ r\\in[q],\\ s_0,s_1\\in[q]^I,\\ \\lambda\\in[n]^I,\\ \\tau\\in\\mathbb B^{[q]\\setminus I}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OBDD}_n\\coloneqq\\{G\\in\\mathcal C_n\\mid\\exists\\rho:[n]\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}[n]\\;\\mathrm{OrderedBDD}_n(G,\\rho)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2042,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-obdd|df-obdd — Ordered binary decision diagrams]]"}],"outgoing":["c4aaed843fab5b1c"]}